    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "shahbanu",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "shahbanu",
      "text": "So the desert did not take you, Arslan. And you have brought my little alchemist home."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "shahbanu",
      "text": "Did she tell you how she begged, the first year? How she swore she would make fire for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "shahbanu",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "camera",
      "x": 5,
      "y": -1.8,
      "viewHeight": 8,
      "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "roxana",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "roxana",
      "text": "I never begged, Parisa. I waited. You took my workshop, my name, and three years of my life."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "roxana",
      "text": "Tonight I take them back, one terrace at a time."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "roxana",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "Where is the Iron Hand? He has stood behind every tyrant we have faced."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "shahbanu",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "shahbanu",
      "text": "Gone west, General, into the mists. The Crown does not wait for its servants to fall."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "shahbanu",
      "text": "But you will not live to follow him. My gardens have never been breached."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "shahbanu",
      "pose": "walk",
      "facing": 1
    },
